# 统一按 LF 入库：CI 在 Linux 上构建，index.html 有「构建后必须与提交一致」的校验，
# 行尾不一致会让 web 工作流误判为过期。gradlew 也必须是 LF 才能在 Linux 上执行。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本保持 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制，不做任何转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.webp binary
*.mp3 binary
*.flac binary
*.wav binary
*.m4a binary
*.ogg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.apk binary
*.jar binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
